oice for <strong data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1385\">ISPs</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1396\">WISPs</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1425\">enterprise networks</strong> requiring reliable connectivity with excellent price-performance.</p><p data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1491\"><br></p><h3 data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1879\"><strong data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1877\">Link Distance:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"2012\"><li data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1936\">\n<p data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1936\"><strong data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1917\">Maximum Line-of-Sight Distance:</strong> Up to <strong data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1934\">25+ km</strong></p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"2012\">\n<p data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"2012\"><strong data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1965\">Typical Reliable Link:</strong> 10–20 km (with clear LOS and good alignment)</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1491\"><br></p><h3 data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1521\"><strong data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1521\">Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1846\"><li data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1557\">\n<p data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1557\">Frequency: 5GHz (5150 – 5850 MHz)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1588\">\n<p data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1588\">Throughput: Up to 400 Mbps</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1632\">\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1632\">Integrated 25dBi High-Gain Dish Antenna</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1672\">\n<p data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1672\">Based on 802.11ac Wave 2 Technology</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1726\">\n<p data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1726\">Point-to-Point and Point-to-Multipoint Compatible</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1758\">\n<p data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1758\">TDD synchronization support</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1797\">\n<p 